{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000001", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Overview: measuring the Signature way", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 1, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. The Signature system measures in its own units: the sig (length), the turn (time), and the heft (mass) form the base, with all other units derived by stated rules. Every Signature measurement carries the same four companions as public ones \u2014 value, unit, instrument, method \u2014 plus a fifth: the conversion factor to SI, exact and stated. Original metrology, honestly labeled, convertible to the world's.", "capabilities": ["Base units: sig (length), turn (time), heft (mass)", "Derived units by stated rules", "Fifth companion: exact SI conversion factor", "Original metrology, convertible to the world's"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Base unit inventory", "code": "const base={sig:'length',turn:'time',heft:'mass'};J({baseUnits:Object.keys(base).length});assert(Object.keys(base).length===3,'sigbase');", "verified_output": "{\"baseUnits\":3}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature length: the sig", "Signature time: the turn"]