{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000002", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature length: the sig", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 3, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. The sig is the Signature unit of length, defined as exactly 0.5 meters \u2014 chosen so everyday human-scale things measure in friendly numbers: a door is about 4 sigs tall, a person about 3.5. Subdivisions: the millisig (0.5 mm) and the kilosig (500 m). The demo converts both directions with the exact factor.", "capabilities": ["The sig: exactly 0.5 meters", "Human-scale friendliness: doors ~4 sigs", "Millisig and kilosig subdivisions", "Exact two-way conversion"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Sig conversion", "code": "const SIG_M=0.5;function toSig(m){return m/SIG_M;}function toM(s){return s*SIG_M;}J({door_sigs:toSig(2.0),back_m:toM(4)});assert(toSig(2.0)===4&&toM(4)===2,'sigconv');", "verified_output": "{\"door_sigs\":4,\"back_m\":2}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature time: the turn", "Signature derived units"]}, "mirror": {"sibling_slug": "measurements-of-things", "direction": "signature-to-public"}}
{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000003", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature time: the turn", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 4, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. The turn is the Signature unit of time, defined as exactly 0.25 seconds \u2014 four turns to the second, a rhythm a human can clap. A minute holds 240 turns; a day holds 345,600. The demo converts durations and computes turns per day.", "capabilities": ["The turn: exactly 0.25 seconds", "Four turns to the second, clappable rhythm", "240 turns per minute; 345,600 per day", "Exact two-way conversion"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Turn conversion", "code": "const TURN_S=0.25;const perDay=86400/TURN_S;J({turnsPerDay:perDay,min_60s:60/TURN_S});assert(perDay===345600,'turnconv');", "verified_output": "{\"turnsPerDay\":345600,\"min_60s\":240}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature length: the sig", "Signature mass: the heft"]}, "mirror": {"sibling_slug": "measurements-of-things", "direction": "signature-to-public"}}
{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000004", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature mass: the heft", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 5, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. The heft is the Signature unit of mass, defined as exactly 2 kilograms \u2014 a bag of flour, a small laptop, a honest heft in the hand. Milliehefts cover grams (one millieheft is 2 grams). The demo converts body-scale masses.", "capabilities": ["The heft: exactly 2 kilograms", "Hand-scale friendliness: a bag of flour", "Milliheft: 2 grams", "Exact two-way conversion"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Heft conversion", "code": "const HEFT_KG=2;function toHeft(kg){return kg/HEFT_KG;}J({person_70kg:toHeft(70),flour_1kg:toHeft(1)});assert(toHeft(70)===35,'heftconv');", "verified_output": "{\"person_70kg\":35,\"flour_1kg\":0.5}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature time: the turn", "Signature derived units"]}, "mirror": {"sibling_slug": "measurements-of-things", "direction": "signature-to-public"}}
{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000005", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature derived units", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 7, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. Derived Signature units follow stated rules: the sig-per-turn is velocity (2 m/s exactly); the heft-sig-per-turn-squared is force (16 newtons exactly); the sig-turn is the storyteller's pace unit. Each derived unit's definition shows its derivation, so no conversion is ever magic. The demo derives velocity and force.", "capabilities": ["Sig-per-turn: velocity, 2 m/s exactly", "Heft-sig-per-turn-squared: force, 16 N exactly", "Derivations shown, never magic", "Stated rules for all derivations"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Derived unit check", "code": "const v=0.5/0.25,f=2*0.5/(0.25*0.25);J({sigPerTurn_ms:v,force_N:f});assert(v===2&&f===16,'derived');", "verified_output": "{\"sigPerTurn_ms\":2,\"force_N\":16}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature mass: the heft", "Signature measured values"]}, "mirror": {"sibling_slug": "measurements-of-things", "direction": "signature-to-public"}}
{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000006", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature measured values", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 9, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. Signature-measured values restate the world in Signature units: Everest stands about 17,698 sigs; the speed of light is about 599,584,916 sigs per turn; a day is 345,600 turns; a liter of water has a heft of 0.5. Each value shows its SI source and the exact conversion, so the Signature measurement and the public one are two doors to the same room.", "capabilities": ["Everest ~17,698 sigs; light ~599,584,916 sigs/turn", "SI source and exact conversion on every value", "Two doors to the same room", "Water liter: heft 0.5"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Everest in sigs", "code": "const everestM=8848.86;const sigs=everestM/0.5;J({everest_sigs:sigs});assert(Math.abs(sigs-17697.72)<0.01,'everestsig');", "verified_output": "{\"everest_sigs\":17697.72}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature derived units", "Signature instrument doctrine"]}, "mirror": {"sibling_slug": "measurements-of-things", "direction": "signature-to-public"}}
{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000007", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature instrument doctrine", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 11, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. The Signature instrument doctrine builds its own measures: the sig-stick (a 4-sig rod, 2 meters, for rooms), the turn-counter (a 4 Hz ticker for timing), and the heft-scale (a balance against standard 1-heft masses). Each instrument record names its construction, its calibration against SI, and its uncertainty \u2014 because a homemade measure must be more honest, not less.", "capabilities": ["The sig-stick: 4-sig room rod", "The turn-counter: 4 Hz timing ticker", "The heft-scale: balance against standard hefts", "Homemade measures, extra honesty"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Sig-stick room measure", "code": "function roomSigs(sticks,extra){return sticks*4+extra;}const r=roomSigs(2,1.5);J({room_sigs:r,meters:r*0.5});assert(r===9.5,'sigstick');", "verified_output": "{\"room_sigs\":9.5,\"meters\":4.75}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"related": ["Signature measured values", "Overview: measuring the Signature way"]}, "mirror": {"sibling_slug": "measurements-of-things", "direction": "signature-to-public"}}
{"id": "JAH-MEASURES-000008", "slug": "measurements-of-things-signature", "title": "The Measurements of Things Signature Database \u2014 Signature conversion tables", "edition": "signature", "src": "signature-generated", "built_by": "assistant-built", "record_kind": "measurement record", "ladder_rank": 13, "body": "Signature edition. Original Signature-developed content; never mixed with public records. The Signature conversion tables are the bridge: every Signature unit to its SI counterpart with exact factors, in both directions, tabulated for quick reference. The tables are generated from the definitions, not hand-typed, so they cannot drift from the unit records. The demo regenerates a row of the table from definitions.", "capabilities": ["Every unit to SI, exact factors, both directions", "Tables generated from definitions, never hand-typed", "No drift between tables and unit records", "Quick-reference bridge"], "demo": {"language": "javascript", "title": "Table row from definitions", "code": "const defs={sig:{toSI:0.5,unit:'m'},turn:{toSI:0.25,unit:'s'},heft:{toSI:2,unit:'kg'}};const row=Object.entries(defs).map(([k,v])=>({unit:k,si:`${v.toSI} ${v.unit}`}));J({rows:row.length,first:row[0]});assert(row.length===3&&row[0].si==='0.5 m','tablegen');", "verified_output": "{\"rows\":3,\"first\":{\"unit\":\"sig\",\"si\":\"0.5 m\"}}", "verified_at": "2026-10-21", "node": "v24.20.0", "run": "node"}, "provenance": {"source_paste": "manons-orders-2026-10-20-database-batch.txt", "paste_item_no": 175, "last_verified": "2026-10-21", "origin": "assistant-built"}, "million_march": {"target": 1000000, "records_now": 8, "status": "march-in-progress"}, "generator": {"hard_cap": 1000000000000000, "ladder": ["simple", "competitive", "mix-and-match", "unmade", "top-notch-or-better", "future-grade", "god-mode"], "self_regulation": true, "stop_when_complete": true}, "ai": {"name": "JAH Measurements Signature Librarian", "scope": "archive-aware", "assistant_maker": true}, "links": {"r